  {
   "id": "bread-fred-204524@major-2024-05-23",
   "gameId": "bread-fred-204524",
   "displayName": "BREAD & FRED ANNIVERSARY UPDATE",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-23T16:13:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Today we celebrate Bread & Fred's 1 year anniversary!!!!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Together with the Nintendo Switch port, we made some changes and have some new stuff to show you",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Meet Pol! Our new big and friendly NPC. He'll race you in a series of challenging and difficult time trials and you'll need to beat his times!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Will you be able to beat him? Or even better! Will you be able to get all medals and prove to Pol and the rest of the village, that you're the one and only CLIMBING MASTER!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enjoy Bread & Fred with this new way to test your abilities and check your coordination with your partner!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also wanted to say thank you to everybody who has been supporting us and the game for one year already. Time flies!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
