  {
   "id": "bread-fred-204524@patch-2023-07-03",
   "gameId": "bread-fred-204524",
   "displayName": "Online Fix Patch!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-07-03T16:56:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "WE NEED YOUR HELP",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, sorry for the inconvenience you've found during the online release. We're still working on them and we'll fix all the issues as soon as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've been tracking down a pretty annoying bug where you couldn't join your friend's games. We've done a couple of things to solve this, but we're not 100% sure if it's fixed. So please, we need you to let us know if you're still experiencing some issues while connecting with your friends.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But for now, here are a bunch of other fixes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[BUG_FIXED] You couldn't join your friend's game! (We don't know if this issue is completely fixed, but we've added a couple of things to help us track down the problem in case it persists. So please, let us know if you're still having issues)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
